      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不要动我们的污泥！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D898152A862114EEC76846C616CE5FF0100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "最近会在街上\n看到很多污泥对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67008FD14F1A572888574E0A000A770B52305F88591A6C616CE55BF95427FF1F00100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你看，\n就是那种东西。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60770BFF0C000A5C31662F90A379CD4E1C897F300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是我灰色的脑细胞灵机一动，\n想到靠清扫污泥也能大赚一笔啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F621170708272768481117EC680DE7075673A4E0052A8FF0C000A60F3523097606E05626B6C616CE54E5F80FD59278D5A4E007B14554A300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我就让应该很擅长用水枪的\n铁臂枪虾作我的搭档，完成了准备。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562115C318BA95E948BE55F8864C5957F75286C3467AA7684000A94C181C267AA867E4F5C62117684642D6863FF0C5B8C62104E8651C65907300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是完全不行！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n铁臂枪虾这家伙，\n根本不肯帮我冲洗污泥。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F5B8C51684E0D884CFF0100100001BE01000A94C181C267AA867E8FD95BB64F19FF0C000A6839672C4E0D80AF5E2E621151B26D176C616CE5300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叽呷啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53FD5477554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我有件事要拜托你！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5621167094EF64E8B898162DC62584F60FF0100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "给我的铁臂枪虾\n展示一下吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n让它看看你的宝可梦\n用水枪冲洗污泥的帅气样子！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ED96211768494C181C267AA867E000A5C55793A4E004E0B5427300200100001BE01000A8BA95B83770B770B4F6076845B9D53EF68A6000A75286C3467AA51B26D176C616CE576845E056C1468375B50FF0100100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
