      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53FD5477554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道你为什么会\n对污泥看也不看一眼了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E590534F604E3A4EC04E484F1A000A5BF96C616CE5770B4E5F4E0D770B4E00773C4E86300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过正因为这样！\n才要清扫污泥啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
