      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53FD5477554AFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不光是清扫污泥！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我还要用你那强得离谱的力量\n向宝可梦对战的世界发起挑战。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D5149662F6E05626B6C616CE5FF0100100001BE01000A62118FD8898175284F6090A35F3A5F9779BB8C317684529B91CF000A54115B9D53EF68A65BF9621876844E16754C53D18D7763116218300200100002011401860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让我们贪心一点，\n不管做什么都爬上顶点吧，搭档！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƆ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
